    <tr><td>Standard 3BHK apartments</td><td>■■■□□</td><td>Bespoke for master bedroom wardrobe and one living-room hero piece; semi-custom elsewhere</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Compact 2BHK apartments</td><td>■■□□□</td><td>Full-bespoke rarely justified; single strategic bespoke element only</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Studio apartments</td><td>■■□□□</td><td>Bespoke for multi-function transformer furniture only — the case is narrow but real</td></tr>
